msgstr "計算中..."

msgid "Export"
msgstr "書き出し"

msgid ""
"convert could not\n"
"be started."
msgstr ""
"convertを起動\n"
"できませんでした。"

msgid ""
"Could not write the\n"
"copy to convert."
msgstr ""
"変換用のコピーを\n"
"書き込めませんでした。"

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "保存できません"

msgid ""
"Could not open the file\n"
"for writing."
msgstr ""
"書き込み用にファイルを\n"
"開けませんでした。"

msgid ""
"The file could not be\n"
"written completely."
msgstr ""
"ファイルをすべて\n"
"書き込めませんでした。"

msgid "Open failed"
msgstr "開けません"

msgid ""
"convert is not on\n"
"this card."
msgstr ""
"このカードに\n"
"convertがありません。"

msgid ""
"The file could not\n"
"be opened."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを\n"
"開けませんでした。"

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未保存の変更"

msgid ""
"This sheet has unsaved\n"
"changes. Save first?"
msgstr ""
"このシートには未保存の\n"
"変更があります。先に保存しますか?"

msgid "Sheet full"
msgstr "シートがいっぱい"

msgid ""
"No room for another cell.\n"
"The change was not made."
msgstr ""
"セルを追加する場所がありません。\n"
"変更はしていません。"

msgid ""
"No room for more cells.\n"
"Some were not pasted."
msgstr ""
"セルを追加する場所がありません。\n"
"一部は貼り付けていません。"

msgid "Fill"
msgstr "フィル"

msgid ""
"Too much to fill\n"
"at once."
msgstr ""
"一度にフィルするには\n"
"多すぎます。"

msgid ""
"No room for more cells.\n"
"Some were not filled."
msgstr ""
"セルを追加する場所がありません。\n"
"一部はフィルしていません。"

msgid "Insert"
msgstr "挿入"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "削除"

msgid ""
"That would push cells\n"
"past the edge of the sheet."
msgstr ""
"セルがシートの端から\n"
"はみ出してしまいます。"

msgid ""
"No room: the sheet\n"
"is full."
msgstr ""
"場所がありません: シートが\n"
"いっぱいです。"

msgid "Format"
msgstr "書式"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"G general  F2 fixed  ,2 1,000.00\n"
"%1 percent  $2 money  (digit: places)"
msgstr ""
"G 標準  F2 固定  ,2 1,000.00\n"
"%1 パーセント  $2 通貨  (数字: 桁数)"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"Not a format: G, F2, ,2,\n"
"%1 or $2 (any 0-8 places)."
msgstr ""
"書式ではありません: G, F2, ,2,\n"
"%1 または $2 (0-8桁)。"

msgid ""
"Too many formatted\n"
"ranges: 64 at most."
msgstr ""
"書式付きの範囲が多すぎます:\n"
"最大64です。"

msgid "Width"
msgstr "幅"

msgid "Column width, in characters:"
msgstr "列の幅 (文字数):"

msgid "Chart"
msgstr "グラフ"

msgid ""
"Select the table to chart\n"
"(labels in the first row\n"
"and column), then F5."
msgstr ""
"グラフにする表を選び\n"
"(1行目と1列目にラベル)\n"
"F5を押してください。"

msgid "Sort"
msgstr "並べ替え"

msgid ""
"Select the rows to sort\n"
"(all their columns), then\n"
"put the cursor in the key."
msgstr ""
"並べ替える行を (すべての列を)\n"
"選び、カーソルをキーの\n"
"列に置いてください。"

msgid ""
"Too large to sort here:\n"
"sort fewer rows at a time."
msgstr ""
"ここで並べ替えるには大きすぎます:\n"
"行を減らしてください。"

msgid "Go to"
msgstr "移動"

msgid "Cell (like B12):"
msgstr "セル (例: B12):"

msgid "Not a cell: A1 to Z999."
msgstr "セルではありません: A1からZ999。"

msgid "Find"
msgstr "検索"

msgid "Not found."
msgstr "見つかりません。"

msgid ""
"A spreadsheet: numbers, text and formulas in a grid.\n"
"\n"
"Type into the cell; =A1*2 is a formula, =SUM(B2:B9) a range. Enter moves down, Tab right, Shift+arrows select.\n"
"\n"
"/, F4\tCommands: insert, delete, number format, width, sort, extend, goto, find, chart\n"
"F2\tEdit the cell\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\tUndo, redo\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tCopy, cut, paste\n"
"Ctrl+D/R\tFill down, right\n"
"Ctrl+1\tNumber format\n"
"Ctrl+G\tGo to a cell\n"
"F3, Ctrl+F\tFind (again: the next match)\n"
"F5\tChart the selection\n"
"Alt+Left\tNarrow the column (Alt+Right widens)\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\tNew, open, save\n"
"\n"
"Functions: SUM AVERAGE MIN MAX COUNT ABS INT ROUND MOD SQRT POWER IF AND OR NOT PMT PV FV NPV VLOOKUP INDEX.\n"
"\n"
"Select a range to see its sum, average and count."
msgstr ""
"表計算: グリッドの中の数値、テキスト、数式。\n"
"\n"
"セルに入力します; =A1*2 は数式、=SUM(B2:B9) は範囲。Enterで下へ、Tabで右へ、Shift+矢印で選択。\n"
"\n"
"/, F4\tコマンド: 挿入、削除、数値の書式、幅、並べ替え、拡張、移動、検索、グラフ\n"
"F2\tセルを編集\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\t元に戻す、やり直す\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tコピー、切り取り、貼り付け\n"
"Ctrl+D/R\t下へ、右へフィル\n"
"Ctrl+1\t数値の書式\n"
"Ctrl+G\tセルへ移動\n"
"F3, Ctrl+F\t検索 (もう一度: 次)\n"
"F5\t選択範囲をグラフに\n"
"Alt+左\t列を狭く (Alt+右で広く)\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\t新規、開く、保存\n"
"\n"
"関数: SUM AVERAGE MIN MAX COUNT ABS INT ROUND MOD SQRT POWER IF AND OR NOT PMT PV FV NPV VLOOKUP INDEX。\n"
"\n"
"範囲を選ぶと合計、平均、個数が出ます。"

